I go into the bedroom.
This room is very nice.
There is a large bed in the room.
Near the bed is a wooden wardrobe.
My suitcase is placed on the floor.
I open my suitcase.
All my clothes are in the suitcase.
I take the clothes out one by one.
I hang my shirts in the wardrobe.
My t-shirts are placed above in the wardrobe.
Some other clothes are placed below.
Now my suitcase is completely empty.
I close the empty suitcase.
I slide it under the bed.
Now the suitcase is lying under the bed.
There is plenty of space in the room now.
All my things are in their place.
